# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DELPHI THREE-ZONE GITIGNORE
# Per specs/006-installer-and-updater.md:
# - Zone 1 (Core System: GOVERNANCE.md, SPEC.md, agents/, skills/) -> Tracked
# - Zone 2 (Team Shared: REVIEW.md, context/, specs/)              -> Tracked
# - Zone 3 (Operator Private & Runtime Ephemeral State)            -> Ignored
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Runtime Daemon Sockets, SQLite Index & Ephemeral Worktrees
.delphi/run/
.delphi/worktrees/
.delphi/state.db
.delphi/state.db-shm
.delphi/state.db-wal
.delphi/logs/
.delphi/sync/quarantine/
.delphi/sync/conflicts/
*.upstream-*
*.tmp

# 2. Operator Secrets & Local Credentials (NEVER commit)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.delphi/config.local.toml
.delphi/identity.private.key

# 3. Operator-Private Agent Coaching Scratchpads (keep directory structure vialessons.md)
memory/agents/*/scratchpad.md

# 4. Scratch & OS Artifacts
scratch/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
